<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">CSS variables defined for the debounce filter.</h2>

    <p>
        The following sections outline all of the css variables that can be set to alter the styling of the debounce filter component.
        You can of course also override its style classes directly.
    </p>
    <p>
        The format and values of these variables althought unique, follow the same as those defined for the inputs
        to keep the look the same as a standard Blazor Ramp input.
    </p>

    <section class="code-table">

